  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v5.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6722b847d1177c0a868431134db24f545fb419fab33593cdefa9874c5db0fa81",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dfee69bfaa802d6ef1511e00fe256ba5ecf9ef2a0f154e21d095c706b02363cb",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nSlippy-Slide\nSkates",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "79f38b3792f222b2d1173235e86935d163ac4a426253606a67414be71c30db0b",
      "text": "Wukong watched them glide.\n“Look! Flying feet!”\n“I want to try!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "67a5153062f9d89beaf5f46aeff55a51770fe317463cecff8e193e0475b1a972",
      "text": "He put on his skates.\nClomp. Clomp.\n“My feet have tiny sleds!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "14f74f2692ec99b4c6fa1ec3541cbe3e8e168ebd25eeead46f636216e577c946",
      "text": "Helmet on. Mittens on.\nCoach Otter checked\nhis skates.\n“Ready for little steps?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "66816c58a09c3eb561c19419e3668ec50abc814d0ca383a4cd1908967d504ac9",
      "text": "Wukong stepped onto the ice.\nHis feet slid apart.\n“Wait for me, feet!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6945bb6f080f82dd814c72eb53cd5d68a1b9d47909a526bc67d9723c27b9903e",
      "text": "Whoops! Down he went.\nHis bottom met the ice.\n“Hello, chilly floor.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "210e7fe1e1d0f0244c673bd50a97720b0945f9a1d17fdcf18deae7f1d1f2b8d4",
      "text": "“Learning takes practice,”\nsaid Coach Otter.\n“Let’s get up together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a727eb221a7a2e119218fa77aa193b91bb53e7482c0f9d4b9a56c7dc09a4440",
      "text": "Little steps. Bent knees.\n“Like a penguin!” said Rabbit.\nWukong waddled and giggled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71b18477d603b88e781e03293bd0c3e5dc047ff9ed2b1ed6e5775c2ade6b9867",
      "text": "Push… glide.\nPush… glide.\nOne tiny slide!\nThen another.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "576994bf8b7fde85b78c0d9fc95882791c8cf5b9ea69c72241c49db9d57695e4",
      "text": "Then came another tumble.\n“I thought I had it.”\nHe sat beside Pigsy.\n“Rest with me,” said Pigsy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2de608dd489cf29a437fea443675e8fe9addb4a2bb8e12b65b57105fcfcf0cdd",
      "text": "They warmed their paws.\nThey watched\nthe swirling snow.\n“I’ll try again,” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf64f6510ea5e51c396c4c4452c14e118ad1123a3652abc6b945eca293965e2e",
      "text": "He came back to practice.\nA little step. A little glide.\nWobbles and all.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f3a3096991eeb8be993cb3f69a9baa84eff98fb5e0b8c05f5bceb6443a671ca9",
      "text": "Then his feet found a rhythm.\nPush… glide.\nPush… glide.\n“Look! I’m doing it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2737e8903f36865ce2762bb8ccd06e4b0417bc093c13cdfe198d835669bdf005",
      "text": "They made a gentle circle.\nRabbit led. Pigsy followed.\nWukong glided along.\nSix happy skates!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47d2b682f9598843b7d96dddaf53d6b175c3bf18846b09943a2f85e5f1da9d54",
      "text": "The rink lights twinkled.\n“See you soon, ice!”\nHis feet were tired.\nHis smile was not.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "97d90eeb8eca1ecc8a34eeee139130848d5e588d92a7146bddda21b6a4132af9",
      "text": "Wukong curled under his quilt.\nIn his dreams,\nhe glided past the stars.\nSlowly. Softly.\nAll the way to sleep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
